Bootstrap: docker
From: python:3.11-slim

%labels
    Author jalil.nourisa@gmail.com
    Description LDSC image — minimal Python + LD Score Regression (ldsc, Python 3 port)

%post
    set -e
    apt-get update -qq && \
    apt-get install -y -qq --no-install-recommends build-essential git zlib1g-dev bedtools && \
    rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*
    pip install --no-cache-dir numpy pandas scipy bitarray ldsc

%environment
    export LC_ALL=C.UTF-8
    export LANG=C.UTF-8

%runscript
    exec python "$@"

%help
    LDSC image — minimal ldsc environment (no scanpy/torch).

    Use ciim.sif for scRNA-seq steps (SEG computation).
    Use ldsc.sif for LD score computation + S-LDSC regression.

    Packages: numpy, pandas, scipy, bitarray, ldsc
    Provides: ldsc.py, munge_sumstats.py, make_annot.py (via ldsc entry-points)

    Usage:
        singularity exec \
            --bind /vol/projects:/vol/projects \
            /vol/projects/BIIM/agentic_immunology/singularity/ldsc.sif \
            python3 /your_script.py
